{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_07_const_is_not_immutable_const_binding", "label": "const protects the binding", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/07-const-is-not-immutable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "const cart = {}; cart.qty = 1 is legal; cart = {} throws TypeError. The name never points at something else."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_07_const_is_not_immutable_object_freeze", "label": "Object.freeze is shallow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/07-const-is-not-immutable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blocks add/remove/change of own properties one level deep. Nested writes still work. Throws in strict, silent in sloppy. Deep freeze needs an isFrozen cycle guard."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_07_const_is_not_immutable_let_const_var", "label": "const let var", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/07-const-is-not-immutable.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "const and let are block-scoped with TDZ. var is function-scoped and initialises undefined. for-of creates a fresh binding so const is correct there."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_07_const_is_not_immutable_const_binding", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_07_const_is_not_immutable_object_freeze", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/07-const-is-not-immutable.md", "source_location": null, "weight":